---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site.js';

const updated = 'July 27, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Just Enuff Cabaret, Rockford IL"
  description="How Just Enuff Cabaret collects, uses, and protects information submitted through justenuffcabaret.com, including our application form."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy <em>Policy</em></h1>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="lead">Last updated {updated}</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="inner-sm" style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;color:var(--grey);font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.7;">
      <p>
        This policy explains what information {business.name} collects through
        justenuffcabaret.com, how we use it, and the choices you have. By using this
        site you agree to this policy.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">Age Requirement</h2>
      <p>
        This site and our venue are intended for adults 21 and older. We do not knowingly
        collect information from anyone under 21. Entry requires a valid government-issued
        photo ID.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong style="color:var(--cream);">Information you give us.</strong> If you submit our
        application form, we collect the details you provide: name, phone number, email address,
        date of birth, city and state, position of interest, prior experience, anything you write
        about yourself, and the photo you upload. We use this only to review and respond to your
        application.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong style="color:var(--cream);">Information collected automatically.</strong> Our
        hosting and security providers process standard technical data such as IP address, browser
        type, and pages requested in order to serve the site and protect it from abuse. We do not
        run advertising trackers on this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong style="color:var(--cream);">Age verification.</strong> When you confirm you are 21
        or older, that confirmation is stored locally in your own browser so we do not ask again.
        It is not transmitted to us.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use the information you submit to evaluate applications, contact you about your
        application or inquiry, operate and secure the website, and comply with legal
        obligations. We do not sell your personal information.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        We rely on a small number of outside service providers to operate this site, including
        website hosting and security services, email delivery services used to send us your
        application, and mapping and review services that display our location and publicly posted
        customer reviews. These providers handle information according to their own privacy
        policies. We do not sell or rent your information to anyone.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">Data Retention &amp; Security</h2>
      <p>
        Application materials are retained only as long as needed for hiring purposes and
        recordkeeping. We take reasonable measures to protect information, though no method of
        transmission over the internet is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">Your Choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may request that we delete the application information you submitted by contacting us
        at <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`} style="color:var(--gold);">{business.email}</a>.
        You can clear the age-verification setting at any time by clearing your browser data.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top reflects the most recent
        revision.
      </p>

      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold-light);font-size:1.4rem;margin:2rem 0 0.6rem;">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        {business.name}<br />
        {business.address.street}, {business.address.city}, {business.address.state} {business.address.zip}<br />
        <a href={business.phoneHref} style="color:var(--gold);">{business.phone}</a> ·
        <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`} style="color:var(--gold);"> {business.email}</a>
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top:2rem;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--grey);">
        This page is provided for general informational purposes and is not legal advice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
